### Media Files ###
# Exclude uploaded course media files (videos and PDFs can be large)
media/courses/*
# But keep the README
!media/courses/README.md

# Exclude uploaded thumbnail images
media/thumbnails/*
# But keep the README
!media/thumbnails/README.md
